WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.760
Interview mein sawaal: Swiggy design karo.

2
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:05.890
Ya Flipkart ki sale. Ya WhatsApp ke blue ticks.

3
00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.353
Tum kaise design karoge?

4
00:00:08.573 --> 00:00:13.218
Zyada tar logon ka dimaag blank ho jaata hai. Kyunki kisi ne real apps se sikhaya hi nahi.

5
00:00:13.618 --> 00:00:16.818
Isiliye: System Design in 21 Days.

6
00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:22.273
Roz ek real Indian app. Roz lagbhag 15 minute. Seedha phone pe.

7
00:00:22.673 --> 00:00:26.473
Day 0 se shuru: system design hota kya hai, Raju ke dhabe se.

8
00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:31.913
Week 1: scale. Flipkart ki Big Billion Day, Swiggy ka dinner rush, Hotstar pe IPL final.

9
00:00:31.913 --> 00:00:35.827
Plus SQL vs NoSQL, sharding, aur OTP login pe rate limiting.

10
00:00:35.897 --> 00:00:42.637
Week 2: real-time aur reliability. Zepto ki queues, WhatsApp ke ticks, Uber ke nearby drivers.

11
00:00:42.637 --> 00:00:47.778
BookMyShow ki seat locking, aur UPI ka double tap. Phir ek mock round.

12
00:00:47.848 --> 00:00:52.748
Week 3: advanced. Instagram feed, Flipkart search, aur Netflix outage.

13
00:00:52.748 --> 00:00:59.038
Aur AI-era system design: ek AI support bot, aur ChatGPT jaisa app kaise chalta hai.

14
00:00:59.038 --> 00:01:03.223
End mein capstone: poora Zepto, end to end, khud design karoge.

15
00:01:03.623 --> 00:01:04.653
Har din ka format same hai.

16
00:01:04.653 --> 00:01:06.783
Pehle tumhara call. Phir 3 minute ki story.

17
00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:09.463
Phir asli mein kya hua, aur uske peeche ka ek idea.

18
00:01:09.463 --> 00:01:13.363
Phir practice: estimates, drag and drop design, aur poora design problem.

19
00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:16.774
Aur end mein interviewer ke follow-ups: jab woh rules badal deta hai.

20
00:01:17.174 --> 00:01:21.049
Har din milega: cheatsheet, ek 2 minute ka interview answer, aur LinkedIn post.

21
00:01:21.449 --> 00:01:24.746
Toh chalo, Day 0 se shuru karte hain. Bas 12 minute.
